 "answer": "[ESCALATED-PRIORITY]\nCD-10416: Customer Message\n\nDear Customer,\n\nThank you for reaching out regarding your recent charge of $75. Your charge was made on August 20th, 2026, which is 76 days prior to today's date. According to our refund eligibility policy, charges made more than 30 days prior are not eligible for a refund. Therefore, we cannot process a refund for this transaction at this time.\n\nWe understand that you may have experienced inconvenience due to the unexpected charge. We recommend checking your organization settings to ensure automatic renewals are properly managed going forward.\n\nPlease let us know if there is anything else we can assist you with.\n\nBest regards,\nCloudDesk Support Team",
